### 2. Run Gunicorn
Perfect! To run your Flask app with Gunicorn **in the background**, you can use the `--daemon` flag. Here’s the full command for your setup:

---

### 1. Activate your virtual environment (if you have one)

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
